 "text": "Bethlehem Feed Mill\nBethlehem Feed Mill\nHome\nBethlehem Feed Mill\nHome\nScroll\nBETHLEHEM FEED MILL, LLC\nCUSTOM AND BULK FEED\n20585 E MO-76 Rocky Comfort, MO 64861\nGET DIRECTIONS\nBETHLEHEM FEED MILL\nFeed Your Way\nSERVICES\nCustom Mixed Feed and Bulk Feed Delivery\nBethlehem Feed Mill is located in Rocky Comfort, Mo.\nWe mix custom feed, fill containers and bags, and deliver bulk feed within a 50 nautical mile radius.\nSend us an Email\nADDRESS\n20585 E MO-76\nRocky Comfort, MO 64861\nView Map\nPHONE\n417-628-3486\nFeed Prices\nCustom Mix Feed $ CALL\nBulk 12% Feed $ CALL\nHorse Feed $ CALL\nCorn $ CALL\nHOURS OF OPERATION\nSunday Closed\nMonday Closed\nTuesday 8am - 5pm\nWednesday 8am - 5pm\nThursday 8am - 5pm\nFriday 8am - 5pm\nSaturday 8am - 5pm\nInGREDIENTS LIST\nDDG (DRIED DISTILLERS GRAIN)\nPEANUT MILL SCREENINGS\nSOYBEAN MEAL\nMOLASSES\nSTOCK SALT\nWHOLE CORN\nCRACKED CORN\nSOYBEAN HULL PELLETS\nCORN GLUTEN PELLETS\nOAT SCREENING PELLETS\nReviews\n“ Super friendly place and custom service. ”\n— Chue Moua\n“\nOur Promise\nBethlehem Feed Mill is committed to producing high quality custom feed. We take pride in our work and guarantee the freshest custom feed for your livestock and farm needs.\n- Brice Holloway, Owner\nAbout Us\nBethlehem Feed Mill has been serving customers for several decades. Ownership has recently changed hands to Brice Holloway. Brice and his family are long time residents of McDonald County.\nIntroduction\nSummary\nFeed Prices\nHours of Operation\nIngredients\nTestimonials\nBethlehem Feed Mill\n20585 E MO-76,\nRocky Comfort, Mo,\nUSA\n417-628-3486\nrussellfarms@yahoo.com\nHours\nMon 8am - 5pm\nTue 8am - 5pm\nWed 8am - 5pm\nThu 8am - 5pm\nFri 8am - 5pm\nSat 8am - 12pm\nSun Closed\nBethlehem Feed Mill\n20585 E. MO-76 Rocky Comfort, MO 64861\nget directions\nPhone\n417-628-3486",
